      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_752554f46bbfef0c27bc2f6259c3145ca4e4774a47531cbbc3c545ca2782117f"
      ],
      "text": "The core package exposes three run modes: runAgent() for a single agent, runTasks() for an explicit pipeline, and runTeam() which plans from a goal."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0983bbf29b4045e2d726bd156f2c8ae292df3a38e4410c80b6029ca6347f58f7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 69,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L63-L69"
        },
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 61,
          "line_start": 60,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L60-L61"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_050a0f1356d2f8c1c539c010a6d22550c12313012c96543fefdfea4189e52424",
        "slc_9aea4e27e380985041a6647916d771d2e523c280a77d635ae4c4753babcd9aab"
      ],
      "text": "An OpenMultiAgent instance is constructed with a default provider/model and an onToolCall callback that can return 'suspend' for consequential tool calls or 'allow' otherwise."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9f8c09e23b31b6a7fb4aff90a02b34b539773ad5c9b8b2bd71b8c6301498ee75",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 150,
          "line_start": 150,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L150-L150"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e5ea24f2c70526d04d536c4234f3197abd7ea6fef6d267709eae10896601641a"
      ],
      "text": "runTeam() uses one model call to turn a goal into a task graph with assignees and dependencies, a deterministic scheduler executes it, and a second call writes the final answer; the coordinator is not consulted mid-run."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6ee9ffd4d6d73ead1fc400701983c223c8b139a5b2358d68a627471c3ff5829d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 91,
          "line_start": 91,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L91-L91"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_38820bcfabd8b8e95ce3aca803d1ab6c55b9ce921dcd8df0111cc388181b6937"
      ],
      "text": "Consequential actions pause for durable approvals: a suspend request is stored beside the checkpoint, bound to a SHA-256 hash of what the reviewer saw, decisions are atomic and first-wins, and tampered requests fail closed."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5d4577bb8e47f59b43b6c9e29ce955b3c5f2dcd3ada059091118a36dc69dae12",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 97,
          "line_start": 97,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L97-L97"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4088d2979ed3c9f8c015c9c7f8609a5d2f588783eb55346fcfe8a872cd9175cf"
      ],
      "text": "The runtime records every model block, tool call, and context rewrite in a journal; verifyRun() checks offline that each block reproduces byte for byte, reporting evicted windows as inconclusive rather than failures."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5a194948e06165e8044e794a22cdcac4add585894c6760c4df609e0587f23b2a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 103,
          "line_start": 103,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L103-L103"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3f52574ee8d54763780b8b359132618ec821f397ed22535a1df021e673f28c9a"
      ],
      "text": "With governanceIntent 'required', runs are judged on an execution receipt of roles, ordering, dependency edges, and independent review; the evaluator never sees agent output text, and a successful run can still report 'unsatisfied'."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_af0fe9f9166a6e7b9c2f52fa9a919e46a1c8857e668601461f3ca209cc1af38c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 44,
          "line_start": 41,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L41-L44"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b45198ba6997d232b3dc7f8437035247e9578de178041ea04e224e68fbe16c7a"
      ],
      "text": "The project requires Node.js 20 or newer; Node 20 is upstream-EOL, kept only as a migration window, and will be removed in the next major release no earlier than 2026-10-31."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b6db8eaf021a8a578de9f07c29be4e9c4f173f63707086d01ea18bfd1aa0af2f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "ea6eb1261c34cf7e539f7265b3d514430eeb7c73",
          "line_end": 111,
          "line_start": 109,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/README.md#L109-L111"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_abed82579077248c3af159ab3caed2bd5e6c80d5223b3ad8b5f13e3eac6de40e"
      ],
      "text": "Built-in provider adapters cover Anthropic, OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Bedrock, Gemini, Grok, Copilot, several Chinese providers, plus Ollama, vLLM, and llama-server via baseURL and any OpenAI-compatible or Vercel AI SDK endpoint."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_85dc8b1c6fe8d4e2b05fbfb52921da3814ef25bba8c39ff4dedcc4101760d8b1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "412dc237f2f803ee3312cbedc459888f033565c2",
          "line_end": 18,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "docs/adaptive-recovery.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/docs/adaptive-recovery.md#L9-L18"
        },
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "412dc237f2f803ee3312cbedc459888f033565c2",
          "line_end": 5,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "docs/adaptive-recovery.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/docs/adaptive-recovery.md#L3-L5"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_efb04ebce4bc2166e34aca905a975907184f235ab78e8095ed3a29e3555e13bb",
        "slc_fb90112f22868fe47a51e46759f81da9ffd93fef735df5efca1c1fd58cba289e"
      ],
      "text": "Adaptive recovery is opt-in via recovery.mode 'repairable': a Replanner or onTaskOutcome callback proposes a PlanPatch, OMA validates it, an optional onPlanPatch gate approves it, and the patch is applied atomically before the triggering task completes."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_21575bcd943e015a5692e0b3247855243cf04e1a986d2bda6ed4ea7103614b72",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420",
          "git_sha": "412dc237f2f803ee3312cbedc459888f033565c2",
          "line_end": 90,
          "line_start": 84,
          "path": "docs/adaptive-recovery.md",
          "repository": "open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/eaeb420c4364e8d63757a7bbdc412655ed6c9420/docs/adaptive-recovery.md#L84-L90"
        },
        {
